description=v3.7.2 the exit at the installer's pace for real: the deep phase and the session phase revert together now (his own log showed a third of a 33s exit spent waiting for the deep phase to finish first), and the navigation overlay is the only ordered step left. The tile is fixed - a stale working sign from a crash can never stick again - and the battery icon is wide, filled, with the S cut out of the fill. The recents icon lives on the SPSM launcher itself, and the app carries none. RMX3430.
